  "content": "<pre>&nbsp;</pre><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"360\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KmjsyQ5QDt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/846551844095918080?color=blueviolet&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=blueviolet&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"201\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=55522716\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=HungryHippo3460&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"186\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/HungryHippo3460/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-Modpacks-important?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=important\" width=\"151\" height=\"27\"></a></strong></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_GettingStarted.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"116\"></p><p>這是一個以戰鬥為核心的模組包，主要圍繞Orca開發的《鬼滅之刃》模組。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>收集資源並建立你的帝國！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Team.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"116\"></p><p><img></p><p>探索這片土地，與惡魔戰鬥或獵食人類。取得專屬的日輪刀，成為鬼殺隊員巡視領土，消滅所有遭遇的惡魔。或者飲下無慘之血化身為鬼，在黑夜中潛行獵食人類。切記在日出前回到室內！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Server.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"129\"></p><p>伺服器目前處於測試階段，歡迎加入！</p><p>DSUnleashed.modded.fun</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;感謝Bisect贊助我們的模組包！</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fdemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"174\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tROaZb0vGy8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>感謝所有模組開發者的貢獻。</p><p>別忘了查看Shadow開發的水產養殖模組</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2 - 模組 - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p>",
